// BUG-001 regression (resuelto v0.0.5): >>~ items must not consume tokens from the next line.
// Before fix: consecutive >>~ statements merged into one; the second line's tokens
// became extra items of the first statement causing parse errors.
// This test verifies that two consecutive >> statements in a function body
// each produce independent output without bleeding into the next line.

renderizar(cabecera, cuerpo, pie) {
    >> cabecera ¶
    >> cuerpo ¶
    >> pie ¶
}

renderizar("header", "body", "footer")
